{"seq":3,"slug":"bulk-sending-queue","title":"批量发送与队列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/implementation/bulk-sending-queue","wordCount":1765,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"批量发送与队列\">批量发送与队列</h1><p>当发送量从每天几百封事务邮件扩展到每周数百万封营销邮件时，系统设计的核心矛盾从「能不能送到」变成「以什么速率送出去不会被接收方拒绝」。批量邮件发送本质上是一个速率受限的分布式调度问题：你的吞吐上限不取决于自己的服务器能力，而取决于每个接收方邮箱提供商允许的入站速率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>批量邮件发送的核心矛盾：你的吞吐上限不取决于自身服务器能力，而取决于每个接收方邮箱提供商允许的入站速率。解决方案是按目标域分片的队列 + 自适应速率控制 + 优先级调度——让关键邮件永远有保证带宽，同时不超出任何一个提供商的容忍阈值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批量发送的速率约束模型\">批量发送的速率约束模型</h2><p>邮箱提供商对入站邮件实施多层速率限制，违反任何一层都会触发 421/429 临时拒收或直接 550 拒绝：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>限制维度</th>\n<th>Gmail 经验值</th>\n<th>Microsoft 经验值</th>\n<th>处理策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每 IP 每分钟连接数</td>\n<td>~20 并发</td>\n<td>~10 并发</td>\n<td>连接池限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每 IP 每小时消息数</td>\n<td>无硬编码，基于信誉</td>\n<td>~3600</td>\n<td>令牌桶限流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每域每天消息数</td>\n<td>动态（信誉驱动）</td>\n<td>~10000（新域）</td>\n<td>逐步预热</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单连接消息数</td>\n<td>~100</td>\n<td>~50</td>\n<td>连接轮换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每收件人每天消息数</td>\n<td>~500（到同一用户）</td>\n<td>~500</td>\n<td>去重+频率上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>核心认知：</strong> 这些限制是动态的——高信誉的 IP/域名获得更高配额，低信誉的被严格限制。这意味着限速策略不能是静态的 <code>N 封/秒</code>，而必须是自适应的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"队列架构设计\">队列架构设计</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 生产者&#10;        CAMP[营销活动触发] --&gt;|百万收件人| SPLIT[分片器]&#10;        SPLIT --&gt;|按域名分片| Q_GMAIL[Gmail 队列]&#10;        SPLIT --&gt;|按域名分片| Q_MS[Microsoft 队列]&#10;        SPLIT --&gt;|按域名分片| Q_YAHOO[Yahoo 队列]&#10;        SPLIT --&gt;|按域名分片| Q_OTHER[其他域队列]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 消费者池&#10;        Q_GMAIL --&gt; W_G[Gmail Worker&lt;br/&gt;自适应限速]&#10;        Q_MS --&gt; W_M[MS Worker&lt;br/&gt;自适应限速]&#10;        Q_YAHOO --&gt; W_Y[Yahoo Worker&lt;br/&gt;自适应限速]&#10;        Q_OTHER --&gt; W_O[通用 Worker]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 反馈循环&#10;        W_G --&gt;|421/550 响应| RL[速率控制器]&#10;        RL --&gt;|调整速率| W_G&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 生产者\n        CAMP[营销活动触发] --&gt;|百万收件人| SPLIT[分片器]\n        SPLIT --&gt;|按域名分片| Q_GMAIL[Gmail 队列]\n        SPLIT --&gt;|按域名分片| Q_MS[Microsoft 队列]\n        SPLIT --&gt;|按域名分片| Q_YAHOO[Yahoo 队列]\n        SPLIT --&gt;|按域名分片| Q_OTHER[其他域队列]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 消费者池\n        Q_GMAIL --&gt; W_G[Gmail Worker&lt;br/&gt;自适应限速]\n        Q_MS --&gt; W_M[MS Worker&lt;br/&gt;自适应限速]\n        Q_YAHOO --&gt; W_Y[Yahoo Worker&lt;br/&gt;自适应限速]\n        Q_OTHER --&gt; W_O[通用 Worker]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 反馈循环\n        W_G --&gt;|421/550 响应| RL[速率控制器]\n        RL --&gt;|调整速率| W_G\n    end</pre><p><strong>按目标域分片</strong> 是批量邮件队列的第一设计原则。原因：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不同邮箱提供商有不同的速率限制</li>\n<li>Gmail 的 421 不应阻塞 Microsoft 队列的消费</li>\n<li>某个域的声誉问题不应影响其他域的发送节奏</li>\n<li>可以针对每个域独立实现自适应限速</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"自适应速率控制算法\">自适应速率控制算法</h2><p><strong>基于反馈的令牌桶：</strong></p>\n<p>传统令牌桶以固定速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 产生令牌。自适应变体根据 SMTP 响应动态调整 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>1.1</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>if 连续 100 封成功</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>if 收到 421/429</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>if 收到 550 且指示限流</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{new} = \\begin{cases} r_{current} \\times 1.1 &amp; \\text{if 连续 100 封成功} \\\\ r_{current} \\times 0.5 &amp; \\text{if 收到 421/429} \\\\ 0 &amp; \\text{if 收到 550 且指示限流} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">连续</span><span class=\"mord\"> 100 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">封成功</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收到</span><span class=\"mord\"> 421/429</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收到</span><span class=\"mord\"> 550 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">且指示限流</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>退避恢复策略：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>收到 <code>421 4.7.28</code>（Gmail 信誉限流）：暂停该 IP 对 Gmail 的发送 5 分钟，然后以 50% 速率恢复</li>\n<li>收到 <code>421 Too many concurrent connections</code>：减少并发连接数而非降低消息速率</li>\n<li>连续 3 个 421：暂停 15 分钟，通知运维</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>实现数据结构：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DomainRateState {&#10;  domain: string;&#10;  currentRate: number; // 当前每秒发送量&#10;  maxRate: number; // 信誉允许的上限&#10;  consecutiveSuccess: number; // 连续成功计数&#10;  lastThrottleAt: Date | null;&#10;  backoffUntil: Date | null;&#10;  activeConnections: number;&#10;  maxConnections: number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DomainRateState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  domain</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currentRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 当前每秒发送量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 信誉允许的上限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  consecutiveSuccess</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 连续成功计数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lastThrottleAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  backoffUntil</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  activeConnections</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxConnections</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"优先级队列与公平调度\">优先级队列与公平调度</h2><p>批量发送场景中经常存在多种优先级的邮件竞争发送资源：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>邮件类型</th>\n<th>延迟容忍</th>\n<th>调度策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>P0</td>\n<td>OTP/2FA</td>\n<td>&lt; 5s</td>\n<td>旁路队列，直接发送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P1</td>\n<td>订单确认、密码重置</td>\n<td>&lt; 30s</td>\n<td>高优先级队列，抢占式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P2</td>\n<td>系统通知</td>\n<td>&lt; 5min</td>\n<td>正常队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P3</td>\n<td>营销活动</td>\n<td>&lt; 1h</td>\n<td>限速队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P4</td>\n<td>非紧急 digest</td>\n<td>小时级</td>\n<td>最低优先级，空闲时发送</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>带权重的公平队列（Weighted Fair Queuing）：</strong></p>\n<p>在 Worker 的每个调度周期内，按权重分配发送配额：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>slots</mtext><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>total_slots</mtext><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{slots}_{priority} = \\text{total\\_slots} \\times \\frac{w_{priority}}{\\sum w}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">slots</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">total_slots</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0436em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>典型权重配置：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{P0} = 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{P1} = 50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{P2} = 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{P3} = 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{P4} = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>但 P0 和 P1 有保证最小配额——即使总速率被限流，关键邮件仍能发出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批量活动的发送编排\">批量活动的发送编排</h2><p>一个百万级营销活动的发送流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    TRIGGER[活动触发] --&gt; SEGMENT[受众分群&lt;br/&gt;100万人]&#10;    SEGMENT --&gt; RENDER[批量渲染&lt;br/&gt;填充个性化数据]&#10;    RENDER --&gt; ENQUEUE[入队&lt;br/&gt;按域分片]&#10;    ENQUEUE --&gt; SCHEDULE[调度器&lt;br/&gt;时区+节流]&#10;    SCHEDULE --&gt; SEND[发送&lt;br/&gt;自适应限速]&#10;    SEND --&gt; TRACK[状态追踪&lt;br/&gt;送达/退信/打开]\">flowchart LR\n    TRIGGER[活动触发] --&gt; SEGMENT[受众分群&lt;br/&gt;100万人]\n    SEGMENT --&gt; RENDER[批量渲染&lt;br/&gt;填充个性化数据]\n    RENDER --&gt; ENQUEUE[入队&lt;br/&gt;按域分片]\n    ENQUEUE --&gt; SCHEDULE[调度器&lt;br/&gt;时区+节流]\n    SCHEDULE --&gt; SEND[发送&lt;br/&gt;自适应限速]\n    SEND --&gt; TRACK[状态追踪&lt;br/&gt;送达/退信/打开]</pre><p><strong>分批入队</strong> 避免瞬间将百万消息塞入队列造成内存/磁盘压力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"批次大小 = min(10000, 队列剩余容量 × 0.3)&#10;批次间隔 = max(1s, 当前队列深度 / 消费速率 × 0.5)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>批次大小 = min(10000, 队列剩余容量 × 0.3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>批次间隔 = max(1s, 当前队列深度 / 消费速率 × 0.5)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>时区感知调度：</strong> 营销邮件在收件人的当地时间早晨 9-10 点发送比半夜发送打开率高 20-30%。这要求：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>收件人数据包含时区信息（或从 IP/地理位置推断）</li>\n<li>调度器计算每个时区窗口的发送量</li>\n<li>跨时区的发送平滑分布避免尖峰</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"队列持久化与容错\">队列持久化与容错</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>队列选型</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>持久化</th>\n<th>吞吐量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Redis Streams</td>\n<td>中小规模（&lt; 100 万/天）</td>\n<td>可选持久化</td>\n<td>10 万+ msg/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RabbitMQ</td>\n<td>中等规模，需要灵活路由</td>\n<td>磁盘队列</td>\n<td>5-10 万 msg/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amazon SQS</td>\n<td>云原生，无需运维</td>\n<td>完全持久化</td>\n<td>按需扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apache Kafka</td>\n<td>大规模（千万级/天）</td>\n<td>完全持久化</td>\n<td>百万级 msg/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BullMQ（Redis）</td>\n<td>Node.js 生态，任务调度</td>\n<td>Redis 持久化</td>\n<td>5 万+ job/s</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>死信队列（DLQ）设计：</strong></p>\n<p>消息在以下情况进入 DLQ：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>重试次数用完（硬退信、永久认证失败）</li>\n<li>消息格式错误（模板渲染失败）</li>\n<li>收件人在黑名单中</li>\n</ul>\n<p>DLQ 中的消息需要人工或自动化审查——它们代表系统的异常状态。定期的 DLQ 分析能发现：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>列表中的无效地址聚集（需要清洗）</li>\n<li>模板 bug（某个变量路径错误导致渲染失败）</li>\n<li>ESP 配置问题（认证失效）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"发送窗口与节流保护\">发送窗口与节流保护</h2><p><strong>反压机制（Backpressure）：</strong></p>\n<p>当下游 ESP API 响应变慢或返回限流信号时，反压需要从消费端传播到生产端：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>消费端感知限流</strong> → 降低拉取速率</li>\n<li><strong>队列深度超阈值</strong> → 拒绝新消息入队，返回 429 给上游</li>\n<li><strong>活动调度层</strong> → 暂停尚未分片的批次</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>每日发送量上限：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>新域/新 IP：每天不超过预热计划允许的量</li>\n<li>成熟域：通常不超过日常均值的 2 倍（突然翻倍会触发信誉审查）</li>\n<li>硬上限保护：即使队列积压也不超过安全阈值</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"去重与频率上限\">去重与频率上限</h2><p>批量发送中的重复风险来源：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>同一用户出现在多个发送列表中</li>\n<li>消息重试导致重复消费</li>\n<li>活动被意外触发两次</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>频率上限（Frequency Cap）规则示例：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>限制</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同一收件人 + 同一活动</td>\n<td>1 封</td>\n<td>绝对去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同一收件人 + 24 小时</td>\n<td>≤ 3 封营销邮件</td>\n<td>防过度打扰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同一收件人 + 7 天</td>\n<td>≤ 7 封营销邮件</td>\n<td>周频率上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同一收件人 + 事务 + 5 分钟</td>\n<td>≤ 3 封</td>\n<td>防邮件轰炸</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实现：Bloom Filter（快速去重检查）+ Redis Sorted Set（滑动窗口频率计数）。Bloom Filter 允许假阳性（少发一封）但不允许假阴性（多发一封）——对邮件系统来说这是正确的取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>批量发送的工程核心：按目标域分片队列实现隔离、自适应令牌桶根据 SMTP 响应动态调速、优先级队列保障关键邮件的最小配额、分批入队防止内存压力、时区感知调度提升打开率、Bloom Filter + 频率上限防止重复和过度打扰。批量发送能力建立后，邮件能否真正进入收件箱取决于<a href=\"../deliverability/reputation-warmup\">域名声誉与预热</a>策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"批量发送与队列","id":"批量发送与队列"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"批量发送的速率约束模型","id":"批量发送的速率约束模型"},{"level":2,"text":"队列架构设计","id":"队列架构设计"},{"level":2,"text":"自适应速率控制算法","id":"自适应速率控制算法"},{"level":2,"text":"优先级队列与公平调度","id":"优先级队列与公平调度"},{"level":2,"text":"批量活动的发送编排","id":"批量活动的发送编排"},{"level":2,"text":"队列持久化与容错","id":"队列持久化与容错"},{"level":2,"text":"发送窗口与节流保护","id":"发送窗口与节流保护"},{"level":2,"text":"去重与频率上限","id":"去重与频率上限"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"邮件模板与渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/implementation/email-template-rendering"},"next":{"title":"域名声誉与预热","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/deliverability/reputation-warmup"}}